d 'FMVARDLURT': module to provide Fourier multivariate ARDL unit-root and cointegration test with any number of covariates and bootstrap critical values
d
d   fmvardlurt adds a Fourier approximation of smooth, unknown
d structural change (Enders and Lee 2012) to the multivariate ARDL 
d   unit-root test of Sam, McNown, Goh and Goh (2025). 
d
d KW: ARDL
d KW: unit root
d KW: cointegration
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261018
d
d Author:  Yusuf Toyin Yusuf,  Kwara State University
d Support: email  YUSUF.YUSUF@@KWASU.EDU.NG
d
f fmvardlurt.ado
f fmvardlurt.sthlp
f ../_/_fmvardlurt_display.ado
f ../_/_fmvardlurt_load.ado
f ../_/_fmvardlurt_mata.ado
f fmvardlurt_diag.ado
f fmvardlurt_example.do
f fmvardlurt_graph.ado
f fmvardlurt_p.ado
